NON-COMMERCIAL IMAGE USE

The 463 images identified as CC-BY-NC-4.0 in ../image_pool/manifest.csv are
licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International
License (CC BY-NC 4.0). Non-commercial sharing and adaptation require attribution. Commercial
use is not licensed under these terms; obtain separate written permission from
China Construction Third Engineering Bureau (Shenzhen) Co., Ltd., the owner of
the source inspection photographs. The licence's exceptions and limitations apply.

Full licence text: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/legalcode

EXCEPTIONS — EXISTING GRANTS ARE PRESERVED

LICENSE_EXCEPTIONS.csv lists 37 files excluded from the non-commercial default:
19 retain CC BY 4.0 permissions associated with the published gold photographs,
and 18 retain the Apache-2.0 permissions associated with published demonstration
photographs. These prior permissions are not withdrawn, and the non-commercial
restriction must not be represented as applying to those files.

CC BY 4.0: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode
Apache-2.0: ../../LICENSE

The combined manifest is the authoritative per-image licence assignment.
Private source-to-demonstration mappings are not included in this repository.

Attribution: Wu, F., Jiang, X., Zhang, W., Wang, B., Gong, J. (2026). ARGus / RCASR research photographs,
Zenodo, https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.21535053.

The source code and rule representation remain under Apache-2.0 (../../LICENSE).
